package m31history063base
    provides [checks, expected_vector, observe, case_body, descriptor, context, check, check_ref, expected_check, evidence, observation, failed, test_case]
    uses [text]

/// M31 HISTORY-063 "Review manifest: closed pact".
/// Source: tests/host-discrimination/admission_test.go
/// symbol TestReviewManifestCoversPrototypes (L126-175):
/// the manifest stays closed, every listed entry is
/// unreviewed plus present, plus every on-disk
/// prototype is listed.
/// Disposition: migrate (this row owns the
/// TestReviewManifestCoversPrototypes offline pact
/// as reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every linked
/// row, variant, environment plus control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the closed pact in manifest
/// order: the file plus status pins, the six listed
/// paths, plus five tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): file pins
/// hold Join arg bytes; status pins hold Go quoted
/// bytes; path pins hold manifest path bytes; counts
/// pin ints tallied from the manifest plus live walk.
/// manifest-file pins REVIEW-MANIFEST.json (L128);
/// manifest-status pins UNREVIEWED-PROTOTYPE (L136);
/// entry-status pins unreviewed (L145 plus L170);
/// path-adapters-storage pins adapters/storage.ts
/// (manifest); path-companions-storage pins
/// companions/storage.ts (manifest);
/// path-adapters-clipboard pins adapters/clipboard.ts
/// (manifest); path-companions-clipboard pins
/// companions/clipboard.ts (manifest);
/// path-adapters-chart pins adapters/chart-widget.ts
/// (manifest); path-companions-chart pins
/// companions/chart-widget.ts (manifest);
/// entry-count pins int (6) from the manifest list;
/// duplicate-count pins int (0) live tally;
/// dangle-count pins int (0) live stat tally;
/// missing-count pins int (0) live walk tally;
/// test-file-count pins int (6) live skip tally.
/// Facet map (pact in manifest order): manifest-file,
/// manifest-status, entry-status,
/// path-adapters-storage, path-companions-storage,
/// path-adapters-clipboard, path-companions-clipboard,
/// path-adapters-chart, path-companions-chart,
/// entry-count, duplicate-count, dangle-count,
/// missing-count, test-file-count.
/// The sweep roots live in
/// history-063-roots-green.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-063-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: no gates (row lists zero environment
/// gates; offline only).
/// Logical gates SUITE/DOC/FILES/BUILD bind at P23;
/// no live run now.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound (no
/// Go timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (P23 accept gate
/// unmet).
/// Case history/review-manifest-base checks:
/// manifest-file, manifest-status, entry-status,
/// path-adapters-storage, path-companions-storage,
/// path-adapters-clipboard, path-companions-clipboard,
/// path-adapters-chart, path-companions-chart,
/// entry-count, duplicate-count, dangle-count,
/// missing-count, test-file-count.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later
/// integrator decision.
